{
  "description": "Wave barrier の再計算: #200 は #201 に依存するので plan の wave は [[201],[200]]。attempt 1 では #201 が pass、#200 が verification 不合格で partial 停止する。--resume した attempt 2 では #201 が引き継ぎ済みなので Wave 1 は 1件も dispatch せず即座に advance し、#200 が **その run の最初の send** として飛ぶ（pass 済みの依存元の worker を待たない）。#201 の worktree は再解決すら要求されない。",
  "plan": {
    "issues_fixture": "cases/02-explicit-dependency/issues.json",
    "orchestrate_args": ["200", "201", "--profile", "node-commandmate", "--max-parallel", "3", "--run-id", "plan"]
  },
  "attempts": [
    {
      "scenario": "attempt-1.json",
      "dispatch_args": ["--expect-branch", "feature/integration"],
      "expect": {
        "exit": 7,
        "status": "partial",
        "stop_reason": "verification_failed",
        "waves_count": 2,
        "wave_dispatched": [[201], [200]],
        "sent": [201, 200],
        "first_sent": 201,
        "verification_outcomes": { "201": "pass", "200": "fail" },
        "report_file": "dispatch-report.json",
        "merge_eligible": [201]
      }
    },
    {
      "scenario": "attempt-2.json",
      "resume": true,
      "dispatch_args": ["--expect-branch", "feature/integration"],
      "expect": {
        "exit": 0,
        "status": "success",
        "stop_reason": "completed",
        "completion_check_passed": true,
        "waves_count": 2,
        "wave_dispatched": [[], [200]],
        "sent": [200],
        "never_sent": [201],
        "first_sent": 200,
        "worker_states": { "201": "completed", "200": "completed" },
        "verification_outcomes": { "201": "pass", "200": "pass" },
        "worker_notes_include": { "201": ["carried over from attempt 1"] },
        "limitation_codes": ["resume_attempt"],
        "absent_limitation_codes": ["resume_no_work"],
        "summary_includes": [
          "引き継ぎ（再 dispatch しない）: #201",
          "再実行対象: #200",
          "引き継ぎ分は Wave barrier 上「完了」として数えるので、依存元が pass 済みの Issue はその Wave を待たずに dispatch される。",
          "Wave 1: dispatch=なし"
        ],
        "report_file": "resume-attempt-2/dispatch-report.json",
        "merge_eligible": [201, 200],
        "history": {
          "attempt": 2,
          "kind": "resume",
          "carried_over": [201],
          "dispatched": [200]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
